==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Aegislash}} in its {{form|Aegislash|Blade Forme}}.
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Battle Styles|Aegislash|107}} from the {{TCG|Battle Styles}} expansion.
*'''Slicing Blade''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Sandstorm|Armaldo|1}} from the {{TCG|EX Sandstorm}} expansion as '''Blade Arms'''.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

